["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑問</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎもん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">疑问；疑惑；怀疑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"168671\"><ruby>子供<rp>(</rp><rt>こども</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>疑問<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がたくさんあります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">孩子有很多疑问。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逆</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎゃく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">相反；对立；逆向；逆命题；逆（函数）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">逆転</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎゃくてん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">形势逆转；翻盘；扭转局面；局面突变；反败为胜；旋转方向的逆转</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"176543\"><ruby>形勢<rp>(</rp><rt>けいせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>逆転<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎゃくてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形势逆转了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ギャング</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">帮派；黑帮；黑帮分子；歹徒</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\