ang=\"ja\">ぎり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">义务；道义；荣誉；礼节；人情债；社交义务；姻亲；婚姻关系</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"182907\"><ruby>義理<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけの<ruby>拍手<rp>(</rp><rt>はくしゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をもらう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只会得到亲戚的赞扬。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">議論</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎろん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">议论；讨论；争论；辩论</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97360\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>議論<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をやめることに<ruby>決<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们决定停止讨论。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑惑</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎわく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怀疑；疑虑；不信任；猜疑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"140923\"><ruby>善<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>あく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>変<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えるのは、「<ruby>疑惑<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎわく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>」である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把善变成恶,就是“怀疑”。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">銀</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ぎん</span></div><div class=\"v-m